"is_used": "Yes",
"explanation": "The text uses loaded language such as 'futile exercise', 'foolish', and rhetorical questions like 'what did he expect??' to evoke emotional responses (dismissiveness, superiority) rather than relying solely on neutral facts. The use of slang ('Bro', 'kusebenza') also adds a colloquial, persuasive tone intended to align with a specific audience."
